Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.65,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(408.325,27.68)}Passport of Satan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.65,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs34.8\)\\pos(328.306,523.92)}Brought to you by: Ko-Fi.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.15,0:00:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, please, say yes!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.27,0:00:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not? I need the money with in 3 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.99,0:00:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No means no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.99,0:00:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But Bell Cop is very famous, it will surely be sold out in but three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.87,0:00:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! I'll just have to borrow the money secretly and return it in 3 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What a genius idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.63,0:00:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita! Why do you want to steal money from my purse, little thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.01,0:00:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum's too mean to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.85,0:00:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She said I'm a little thief and will become an improper man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.43,0:00:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't blame her. You tried to steal the money, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.69,0:00:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I've made up my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.78,0:00:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll become an {\i1}evilest{\i0} person in the whole world...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.44,0:00:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...and show her just how bad her son can be!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.49,0:00:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a gadget that does the job!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.49,0:01:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I have no such gadgets!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.49,0:01:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.49,0:01:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! He pulled out the Passport of Satan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This Passport is so worst that...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.29,0:01:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,All you need to do is show this passport to someone and then....
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.13,0:01:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,... even if you sin a wickedest sin, you won't be punished back by karma.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.76,0:01:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what sins I commit...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.55,0:01:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm afraid...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You just show them and it does the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.85,0:01:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, that is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.52,0:01:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always wanted a gadget like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.57,0:01:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme that back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.03,0:01:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, don't be so closed-minded!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You stole it from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.38,0:01:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright, you can have it and do whatever you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.01,0:02:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what do you think you're doing?>
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.44,0:02:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You can even take that wallet, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.24,0:02:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But I need only {\fnCalibri}¥{\fnBalloon Lettering}1000.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.57,0:02:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurray!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.20,0:02:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can now do whatever I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.62,0:02:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I kicked that dustbin and dirtied the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.45,0:02:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.75,0:02:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.29,0:02:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.80,0:02:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.13,0:02:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, Nobita.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.30,0:02:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Teacher, I'll cheat in next exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.93,0:02:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.93,0:02:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.06,0:02:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take a nice peek of your panties...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.23,0:02:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.74,0:03:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can now buy Bell Cop manga at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.24,0:03:08.50,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\frz14.13\pos(199.218,184.08)}Bell Cop
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.46,0:03:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't have to pay any money, as long as I have this passport.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.55,0:03:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take it home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not? Of course you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.47,0:03:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please visit again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay! I stole it boldly! I'm now like Lupin the phantom thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.85,0:03:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But the owner of the store loses {\fnCalibri}¥{\fnBalloon Lettering}350.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.11,0:03:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite costly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.15,0:03:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I do feel bad for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.55,0:04:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you enjoyed doing evil deeds?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.72,0:04:09.39,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\frz14.13\pos(333.954,164.88)}Bell Cop
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:11.02,Sign,,0,0,0,,Now I'm gonna read it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel bad for Mum though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.94,0:04:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She has hard time at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.20,0:04:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Bell Cop is so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.34,0:04:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.38,0:04:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, you're a pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.81,0:04:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I went too overboard...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.44,0:05:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so weak that you're sad about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.03,0:05:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.57,0:05:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so wimpy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.57,0:05:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible for you to ever be evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.99,0:05:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't work for you, Clumsy! Wimp! Coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.04,0:05:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadduppppp!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.34,0:05:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.84,0:05:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to pay me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.14,0:05:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.95,0:05:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Need a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.50,0:05:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Here have this back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you done, already?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.21,0:06:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll return Mum's {\fnCalibri}¥{\fnBalloon Lettering}1000.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.09,0:06:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.72,0:06:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to return the book!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.93,0:06:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.81,0:06:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to for you to be evil. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.23,0:06:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to get {\fnCalibri}¥{\fnBalloon Lettering}650 back from the shopkeeper, the manga was only {\fnCalibri}¥{\fnBalloon Lettering}350!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.82,0:06:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I need my {\fnCalibri}¥{\fnBalloon Lettering}650 back!
